  "concern": [
    {
      "@type": "ConcernDetail",
      "concernType": "adult.neglect",
      "description": "Visited today to dress a grade 2 pressure ulcer on Margaret's sacrum, first noted on 17 Nov. The medication record in the house shows her evening Parkinson's medication was not given on 6 of the last 14 days. The carers' visit log shows the evening call late by over an hour on several days and no evening call at all on 3 days. Margaret had another fall on Saturday night trying to get to the toilet on her own. No injury, but she was on the floor for about 40 minutes before the pendant alarm was answered. I think she is being left too long without help."
    }
  ],
